.TH PRAY 1 "July 2026" "pray" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pray \- reproducible inference input composition for projects
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pray
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.I COMMAND
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pray
resolves declared Prayfile dependencies, locks versions and hashes, and renders
tool-specific output with compact provenance markers.
.PP
Declare shared instructions in
.BR Prayfile ,
lock exact versions, and keep shared input pinned through manifest and lockfile
semantics.
.SH GETTING STARTED
.nf
pray init
pray install
pray plan
pray apply
pray verify
.fi
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-path " PATH"
Project root (default: current directory).
.TP
.BI \-\-file\-path " PATH"
Prayfile path.
.TP
.BI \-\-env " NAME"
Environment name for render filtering.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-input
Disable interactive prompts.
.TP
.B \-\-rm
Use an ephemeral home directory for this invocation.
.TP
.B \-\-trust
[\fB\-\-global\fR]
Import trust on first use.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help for pray or one command.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the pray CLI version.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS Workflow
.BR install ", " plan ", " apply ", " verify ", " drift ", " render ", " format
.SS Packages
.BR add ", " remove ", " update ", " unlock ", " vendor ", " clean
.SS Distribution
.BR publish ", " yank ", " token ", " login ", " serve ", " sync ", " confess
.SS Trust
.B trust
with subcommands list, show, add-key, remove-key, set-signed,
set-require-signed-packages, set-allow, import-repo, import-registry, check.
.SS Inspect
.BR list ", " search ", " outdated ", " explain ", " tree
.SS Meta
.BR init ", " prayer\ init ", " repo\ init ", " manifest ", " package ", "
.BR upgrade ", " version ", " completion ", " help
.PP
Run
.B pray help
.I COMMAND
or
.B pray
.I COMMAND
.B \-\-help
for details on one command.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
General error (I/O, missing or invalid manifest context).
.TP
.B 2
Parse error or usage/CLI argument error.
.TP
.B 3
Resolution error.
.TP
.B 4
Integrity error.
.TP
.B 5
Render/check failed.
.TP
.B 6
Verify failed (also when
.B pray drift
finds drift).
.TP
.B 7
Network/fetch error.
.TP
.B 8
Unsupported feature.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I Prayfile
Project manifest.
.TP
.I Prayfile.lock
Locked resolution and managed span records.
.SH SEE ALSO
docs/cli-exit-codes.md,
RFC 0040,
.UR https://github.com/kiskolabs/pray
.UE
.SH COMPLETIONS
Emit shell completion scripts:
.PP
.nf
pray completion bash
pray completion zsh
pray completion fish
.fi
